{"asset_key":"ep7/env_story_17323260","episode":"ep7","category":"env_story","story_id":"17323260","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1732326001:1":{"text":"ええ、行方不明だった旦那様たちがこぞって言ってるの。ローランド大帝のおかげで助かったって……","source_cn":"没错，那些失踪的老爷们回来后都在说，这次全靠罗兰大帝庇佑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5FCBE2EB4D85024F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1732326002:1":{"text":"でも、なんで古聖堂に悪魔がいるんだよ？これもまさか王妃の陰謀か？","source_cn":"可是圣古堂怎么会有恶魔呢？难道这也是王后阴谋中的一环？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2F386EB155C452A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1732326003:1":{"text":"それで、その悪魔はどうなったんだよ？ローランド大帝が倒したのか、それとも逃げたのか？","source_cn":"那些恶魔呢？他们是被显灵的罗兰大帝消灭还是逃跑了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1ED3999E96E5A03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1732326004:1":{"text":"まさか、まだこの辺りに潜んでたりしないよな……？","source_cn":"你说会不会有恶魔藏在附近的某个角落吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2773E20369BD5D0E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:商贩博斯坦":{"text":"商人のボスタン","source":"商贩博斯坦","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:工人米特":{"text":"作業員のミット","source":"工人米特","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:工人卡尔特":{"text":"作業員のカルト","source":"工人卡尔特","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"local